OL,3,GNEWSANI secretary meets Stormont
OL,4,Aparties to discuss budget deadlock
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe secretary of state is in Northern
OL,7,FIreland for meetings with executive
OL,8,Fparties about the budget deadlock.
OL,10,FSir Chris Bryant, who has insisted
OL,11,Fthere is no more money available beyond
OL,12,Fthe #1.5bn the government has already
OL,13,Foffered, has accused executive
OL,14,Fministers of being financially
OL,15,F"irresponsible".
OL,17,FHaving held brief virtual discussions
OL,18,Fwith parties last Friday, Sir Chris met
OL,19,Fleaders of the four executive parties
OL,20,Fseparately at Stormont on Thursday.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,416,410,260,120,0,100
